    "open_questions": [
      "His birth date: 28 November 1988 only from Famous Birthdays; his first show at twenty-five (Modern Drummer, 2018) fits it.",
      "Whether his kick runs are on two pedals or one: Modern Drummer names \"Iron Cobra 900 Power Glides\" and Equipboard, from Tama, the twin pedal; New Noise says gospel drummers moved him away from double bass. His feet are out of shot in the playthroughs.",
      "The Audacity (2022), his own written drum solo: no human transcription found (Songsterr 6218650 is machine-made); not scored.",
      "The x on the middle line of Ahn's Playing God score: a second snare or a cross-stick; those bars are not scored.",
      "Be Not Afraid (23 October 2026) and its single Power in the Blood: not yet scored.",
      "Which tracks of New Levels New Devils, if any, carry programmed drums under his: Miller hears \"backing track\" kick sixteenths in G.O.A.T."
    ]
  },
