    "roles": ["band_member", "touring"],
    "summary": "Polyphia's drummer from 2016: a Texas drummer who marched quads in a high-school drumline, gave up the drums for five years, then quit a corporate job to practise six to eight hours a day and played his first show at twenty-five. He came to Polyphia through a fill-in tour with Invent Animate. On New Levels New Devils (2018) and Remember That You Will Die (2022) he plays trap beats on a kit, hats in sixteenths and thirty-seconds under the snare on 3, with three stacks played off the hat and in place of a side snare, and gospel chops in the fills, after Eric Moore, Matt Garstka, Mike Mitchell and Devon Taylor."
  },
